      "id": "sol.amc-10-2001-p10.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Dividing \\(xz=48\\) by \\(xy=24\\) gives \\(z=2y.\\) Then \\(yz=2y^2=72,\\) so \\(y=6,\\) \\(z=12,\\) and \\(x=\\frac{24}{y}=4.\\)\n\nHence \\(x+y+z=22.\\) Thus, the correct answer is D.",
